{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/2531","id":4722757194,"node_id":"PR_kwDOQQhC388AAAABGX-OSg","html_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2531","diff_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2531.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pull/2531.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/issues/2531","number":2531,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(HIGH): SCI-HERO typed tipping-point fact with exact display threshold","user":{"login":"Talchain","id":30796128,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzk2MTI4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30796128?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain","html_url":"https://github.com/Talchain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Talchain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When a served Run contains a valid factor crossing, the Agent receives one typed tipping-point fact with the original factor identity, display values, direction and unit. The existing positive remains Pro plan price 49 → 55.76 GBP/month, with neutral wording and no winner or EVPPI dependency.\n\nThis is PR 1 of Paul's narrowed tipping-point journey. It reuses the existing flip parser and display predicate, selects the first valid row in producer order, and keeps no-signal, unresolved and absent science distinct. The enclosing selected analysis result retains its existing Run hash/identity; no new currentness authority is introduced.\n\nThe final diff is only `decision-sensitivity.ts` and `tipping-point-for-agent.test.ts`. The prior prompt/ranking change and nested permission-masking change have been removed. Shared Data retains permission ownership; Context P0 owns the canonical follow-up projection. PR 2 adds deterministic coaching/checker/fallback; a targeted action is conditional on the existing refinement path failing the journey.\n\nValidation at 918f1c7a0504ff7cd94071b7d80cb386359c2f6c:\n- 32 focused tests pass, including the real served positive/control, withheld winner, display-safe row selection and unchanged EVPPI semantics.\n- `pnpm typecheck` and changed-file lint pass.\n- Four mutants killed: wrong factor, wrong threshold, wrong direction, reversed crossings.\n- Exact-head Required CI is pending and remains the release gate. The 127-row science validation is inherited; no new broad science run.\n\nNo schemas, PLoT, shared keep-list/status transport, VOI actions, winner transport, stability bands or UI changes. VOI is scientifically available; a product-positive case is not currently demonstrated on the served model shape.\n\nHIGH: model-facing interpretation changes. Independent exact-head review and the serial DL/successor merge slot are required. This is source/fixture evidence; it is not yet served or JOURNEY-WITNESSED.\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T00:06:49Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T01:29:07Z","closed_at":"2026-10-03T01:29:07Z","merged_at":"2026-10-03T01:29:07Z","merge_commit_sha":"aff2be2c8a80e393bb4bb28a506992c1ff314758","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistants-service/pulls/2531/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Talchain/olumi-assistan